---
const tel = "059-271-5908";
const telHref = "tel:0592715908";
const metas = [
  "営業時間 9:00〜18:00",
  "不定休",
  "翌営業日中に一次返信",
  "損害保険完備",
];
---

<section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-navy to-navy-deep text-white py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute -top-24 -left-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-sky/30 blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="absolute -bottom-24 -right-24 w-96 h-96 rounded-full bg-accent/20 blur-3xl"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 text-center">
    <span class="label-en !text-sky-light">CONTACT</span>
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black leading-tight mt-3">
      暮らしを、<br />もっとキレイに。
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-7 text-sky-light leading-relaxed">
      料金をその場でご確認いただけます。<br class="md:hidden" />送信後、栗田より折り返しご連絡いたします。
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 bg-white text-text rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-xl">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold/20 text-accent-deep px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-black mb-5">
        ★ おすすめ ／ カート式申込みで料金が即わかる
      </div>

      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="block w-full px-8 py-5 rounded-2xl bg-accent hover:bg-accent-deep text-white font-black text-base md:text-lg shadow-orange transition-colors"
      >
        📋 お申込み・見積もりフォーム →
      </a>

      <div class="my-5 text-xs text-muted flex items-center gap-3 justify-center">
        <span class="h-px flex-1 max-w-16 bg-line"></span>
        または
        <span class="h-px flex-1 max-w-16 bg-line"></span>
      </div>

      <a
        href={telHref}
        class="block bg-bg-soft hover:bg-sky-pale rounded-2xl py-4 transition-colors border border-line-soft"
      >
        <div class="text-xs text-muted">📞 お電話でのご相談</div>
        <div class="num-mont text-3xl text-navy font-black mt-1">{tel}</div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2 justify-center">
      {
        metas.map((m) => (
          <span class="text-[11px] bg-white/10 backdrop-blur text-sky-light px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-white/20">
            {m}
          </span>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
